description=Standalone dual-SIM IMS service with self-owned pure-Go VoWiFi engine, per-slot toggles (all SIMs unlocked), dual isolated built-in Clash cores (wfctun0/wfctun1), cross-baseband SIM AKA, resident Root daemon, and Android 14-17 support.
